#! seed 1861
#! files cws1.sav cws2.sav cws.his oldhist.ory CWS.CFG
# Civil War Strategy: the Files menu and Resume Saved Game (QB64Rust's tools/screen/README.md, "Places and rules").
# Resume Saved Game at the title menu finds no saved game and goes to the main menu. Files shows Load as "-",
# and it stays "-" for the rest of this game, also after a save: its key goes back to the Files menu. Save writes
# cws1.sav; after a recruit, Save writes cws2.sav (cws1.sav is marked as used). Quit, No. New Game goes back to
# the title menu, where Resume Saved Game now lists the two saved games: cws1.sav, the game before the recruit.
# In that game Load is offered: cws2.sav, the game after the recruit; Load again, left with Esc. History on, and
# New Game writes the configuration; Start NEW Game begins a history file; Inform has Recap; one more New Game
# and Start NEW Game copy the history file to oldhist.ory. Then END TURN by rules to the game's end, the Hall of
# Fame, Game Over and Quit. The saved games, the history files and the configuration are checked after the run.

# The waits of the computer's turns: a space each; a Retreat menu: the city it starts on; a main menu: END TURN;
# the End Turn and End Game menus: Yes; the Options at the end: Quit this Game.
rule 1 key space
rule 2:M text e
rule 2:E text y
rule 2:R key enter
rule 2:O text q

# The title menu: Resume Saved Game (none is found: the main menu comes).
play until 2:V
digest
text r
# March 1861. Files: Load is "-". Save, to cws1.sav.
play until 2:M
digest
text f
prompt
digest
text s
prompt
digest
key enter
# Troops: recruit at the first city, then out.
prompt
text t
prompt
key enter
prompt
key esc
# Files: the "-" of Load, by its key: the Files menu again. Save: cws1.sav is marked; down to cws2.sav.
prompt
text f
prompt
text -
prompt
digest
text s
prompt
digest
key down
prompt
key enter
# Files: Quit, No.
prompt
text f
prompt
text q
prompt
digest
text n
# Files: New Game, to the title menu: Resume Saved Game; the Load menu: cws1.sav.
prompt
text f
prompt
text n
prompt
text r
prompt
digest
key enter
# The game before the recruit. Files: Load is offered now; down to cws2.sav: the game after the recruit.
prompt
digest
text f
prompt
digest
text l
prompt
key down
prompt
key enter
prompt
digest
# Files: Load, left with Esc.
text f
prompt
text l
prompt
key esc
# UTILITY: History on, out. Files: New Game (the configuration written with history on), to the title menu again:
# Start NEW Game, which begins a history file.
prompt
text u
prompt
text h
prompt
key esc
prompt
text f
prompt
text n
prompt
digest
text s
# Inform: Recap, now that there is a history file; a key.
prompt
text i
prompt
key up
prompt
key enter
prompt
digest
key space
# Files: New Game once more; Start NEW Game: the history file is kept as oldhist.ory and a new one begun.
prompt
text f
prompt
text n
prompt
text s
play until 2:M
state
text e
# Turns to the end: the main menu, END TURN (and Yes by the rule).
repeat 7
play until 2:M
digest
text e
end
# The game's end: End Game (Yes by the rule), the Options: Quit; the Hall of Fame: the commander's name; Game Over;
# the title menu: Quit; END's key.
play until 2:O
state
text q
play until 4
text Grant
key enter
play until 1:G
digest
key space
play until 2:V
digest
text q
repeat space
